  2026-11-10 - Deeper architecture and technology research recorded locally.
      Action: inspected primary desktop/native-speech/protocol/cloud/storage
        references and installed resume/permission documentation.
      Effect: recommend Tauri 2/Rust with React/TypeScript/Three.js, native audio
        and SQLite; retain Electron as a fallback and explain the revision.
      Mechanism: separate policy/job authority from UI/audio, constrain IPC,
        bind identities/approvals, preserve uncertain dispatch and distinguish
        qualified success from agent-reported completion. Expand roadmap packages
        and reproducible useful-answer/resource/quality measurements.
      Evidence: technology-decisions, runtime-contracts,
        performance-and-qualification and research-sources under docs.
